  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Recruitment of a Health and Human RIghts Officer to work both at Ministry of Health and at WHO Uganda in order to address and promote a rights-based approach in all policies, planning and programming of health sector programmes and to mainstream human rights. The position is for 1 year only to strengthen capacities at both institutions.</narrative>
